wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 为其选定分类子上的 LT 拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\hookrightarrow X\">\\(m:A\\hookrightarrow X\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 中的单态射；j-闭包及稠密、闭见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ce0c3e433ca617db\" href=\"?note=ce0c3e433ca617db\" title=\"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism\">14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1131fa8ff0b18434\" href=\"?note=1131fa8ff0b18434\" title=\"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism\">14-df-j-closed-monomorphism</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j)\\land\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}(m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j)\\land\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}(m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：闭性给 Cl_j([m])=[m]，稠密性给 Cl_j([m])=[1_X]，故两子对象类相同。由子对象等价定义，m 与恒等单射相差一个同构，因而 m 为同构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text